stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> PENDING
 PENDING --> READY: dependencies complete
 READY --> RUNNING
 RUNNING --> COMPLETED: task succeeds
 RUNNING --> FAILED: exception / timeout / invalid output
 FAILED --> RETRYING: retry budget remains
 RETRYING --> RUNNING: attach error context
 FAILED --> ESCALATED: retry budget exhausted
 COMPLETED --> VALIDATION
 VALIDATION --> RECOVERY: validation fails
 RECOVERY --> READY: targeted task reopened
 VALIDATION --> REVIEW: all gates pass
 REVIEW --> NEEDS_APPROVAL
 NEEDS_APPROVAL --> APPROVED: human approves
 NEEDS_APPROVAL --> REJECTED: human rejects
